id: pm-ozxkm2
title: "CodeQL: remove generated-code artifact path interpolation from exporter integration harness"
description: Resolve CodeQL alert #36 (js/bad-code-sanitization) in PR #1053 by passing the disposable artifact path to the generated extension through a controlled environment variable instead of interpolating it into JavaScript source. Preserve the file-artifact integration assertion and keep CodeQL enabled.
