parent: pm-mav1ak
severity: medium
environment: PR #1053 exact head ee3960b3c; tests/integration/extension-host-contracts.integration.spec.ts
repro_steps: Open CodeQL alert #36 or run the hosted CodeQL analysis on PR #1053; it reports js/bad-code-sanitization at the generated writeFileSync path expression.
resolution: Removed the path-to-generated-code interpolation by carrying the disposable artifact destination through the test process environment and validating it at runtime.
expected_result: "Generated test extensions obtain the harness-controlled artifact destination as runtime data, and CodeQL reports no bad-code-sanitization alert."
actual_result: "Focused integration coverage passes 8/8 with the artifact bytes and receipt unchanged; the source pattern reported by CodeQL alert #36 is gone, pending exact-head hosted confirmation."
